msgstr "What is most indispensable before a spell-card contest begins?"

#. gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.0.C01.3.0
#: src/data/gaokao.js:75
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.0.C01.3.0"
msgid "Publish the name and round count, leaving termination to the side with greater firepower"
msgstr "Publish the name and round count, leaving termination to the side with greater firepower"

#. gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.0.C01.3.1
#: src/data/gaokao.js:75
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.0.C01.3.1"
msgid "Have both sides confirm the name, rules, and an exit each can identify"
msgstr "Have both sides confirm the name, rules, and an exit each can identify"

#. gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.0.C01.3.2
#: src/data/gaokao.js:75
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.0.C01.3.2"
msgid "Let the referee hold the full rules while participants know only the start signal"
msgstr "Let the referee hold the full rules while participants know only the start signal"

#. gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.0.C01.3.3
#: src/data/gaokao.js:75
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.0.C01.3.3"
msgid "Set the name and exit first, then write the rules around the opening round"
msgstr "Set the name and exit first, then write the rules around the opening round"

#. gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.0.C01.5
#: src/data/gaokao.js:75
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.0.C01.5"
msgid ""
"These elements make the contest identifiable and endable; raw power does not "
"create rules."
msgstr ""
"These elements make the contest identifiable and endable; raw power does not "
"create rules."

#. gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.1.C02.2
#: src/data/gaokao.js:76
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.1.C02.2"
msgid "A library book starts flying toward an open window. What is the best first step?"
msgstr "A library book starts flying toward an open window. What is the best first step?"

#. gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.1.C02.3.0
#: src/data/gaokao.js:76
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.1.C02.3.0"
msgid "Close the window first and identify the book later from memory of its cover"
msgstr "Close the window first and identify the book later from memory of its cover"

#. gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.1.C02.3.1
#: src/data/gaokao.js:76
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.1.C02.3.1"
msgid "Note the call number, alert staff, and close nearby windows"
msgstr "Note the call number, alert staff, and close nearby windows"

#. gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.1.C02.3.2
#: src/data/gaokao.js:76
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.1.C02.3.2"
msgid "Restrain it with the nearest collection seal, then ask whether that seal was compatible"
msgstr "Restrain it with the nearest collection seal, then ask whether that seal was compatible"

#. gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.1.C02.3.3
#: src/data/gaokao.js:76
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.1.C02.3.3"
msgid "Move it into an empty display case for observation without yet alerting staff or readers"
msgstr "Move it into an empty display case for observation without yet alerting staff or readers"

#. gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.1.C02.5
#: src/data/gaokao.js:76
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.1.C02.5"
msgid ""
"Control the reversible environmental risk, preserve identification, and "
"involve the responsible staff."
msgstr ""
"Control the reversible environmental risk, preserve identification, and "
"involve the responsible staff."

#. gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.2.C03.2
#: src/data/gaokao.js:77
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.2.C03.2"
msgid ""
"A kappa prototype sparks blue while its note says normal sparks are green. "
"What should you do?"
msgstr ""
"A kappa prototype sparks blue while its note says normal sparks are green. "
"What should you do?"

#. gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.2.C03.3.0
#: src/data/gaokao.js:77
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.2.C03.3.0"
msgid "Record the blue sparks and continue at low power to see whether they are a new feature"
msgstr "Record the blue sparks and continue at low power to see whether they are a new feature"

#. gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.2.C03.3.1
#: src/data/gaokao.js:77
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.2.C03.3.1"
msgid "Stop operation, preserve the scene, and notify workshop duty staff"
msgstr "Stop operation, preserve the scene, and notify workshop duty staff"

#. gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.2.C03.3.2
#: src/data/gaokao.js:77
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.2.C03.3.2"
msgid "Remove power and casing immediately, documenting the original state afterward"
msgstr "Remove power and casing immediately, documenting the original state afterward"

#. gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.2.C03.3.3
#: src/data/gaokao.js:77
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.2.C03.3.3"
msgid "Quarantine the machine and revise the normal colour to blue pending the next shift"
msgstr "Quarantine the machine and revise the normal colour to blue pending the next shift"

#. gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.2.C03.5
#: src/data/gaokao.js:77
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.2.C03.5"
msgid "The colour differs from the documented normal state; stop before rewriting the standard."
msgstr "The colour differs from the documented normal state; stop before rewriting the standard."

#. gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.3.C04.2
#: src/data/gaokao.js:78
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.3.C04.2"
msgid ""
"A misleading headline was written by the corrections lecturer. What is the "
"soundest response?"
msgstr ""
"A misleading headline was written by the corrections lecturer. What is the "
"soundest response?"

#. gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.3.C04.3.0
#: src/data/gaokao.js:78
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.3.C04.3.0"
msgid "Correct the facts publicly but omit the author's role to avoid personalizing the issue"
msgstr "Correct the facts publicly but omit the author's role to avoid personalizing the issue"

#. gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.3.C04.3.1
#: src/data/gaokao.js:78
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.3.C04.3.1"
msgid "Publish a correction and record the author's conflict of interest in the case"
msgstr "Publish a correction and record the author's conflict of interest in the case"

#. gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.3.C04.3.2
#: src/data/gaokao.js:78
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.3.C04.3.2"
msgid "Wait for internal review, then silently replace the original headline"
msgstr "Wait for internal review, then silently replace the original headline"

#. gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.3.C04.3.3
#: src/data/gaokao.js:78
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.3.C04.3.3"
msgid "Retain the headline and disclose the author's role, leaving credibility to readers"
msgstr "Retain the headline and disclose the author's role, leaving credibility to readers"

#. gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.3.C04.5
#: src/data/gaokao.js:78
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.3.C04.5"
msgid ""
"Her institutional role increases the need for a visible correction and "
"conflict disclosure; it does not waive it."
msgstr ""
"Her institutional role increases the need for a visible correction and "
"conflict disclosure; it does not waive it."

#. gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.4.C05.2
#: src/data/gaokao.js:79
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.4.C05.2"
msgid "On a full-moon clinic visit, the main corridor is closed. Which route should be used?"
msgstr "On a full-moon clinic visit, the main corridor is closed. Which route should be used?"

#. gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.4.C05.3.0
#: src/data/gaokao.js:79
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.4.C05.3.0"
msgid "Take the Main House corridor because the clinic remains in the same complex"
msgstr "Take the Main House corridor because the clinic remains in the same complex"

#. gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.4.C05.3.1
#: src/data/gaokao.js:79
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.4.C05.3.1"
msgid "Follow full-moon diversion from Main House through Pharmacy to the Clinic"
msgstr "Follow full-moon diversion from Main House through Pharmacy to the Clinic"

#. gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.4.C05.3.2
#: src/data/gaokao.js:79
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.4.C05.3.2"
msgid "Wait at Yesterday's Clearing and infer the clinic direction from the campus bell"
msgstr "Wait at Yesterday's Clearing and infer the clinic direction from the campus bell"

#. gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.4.C05.3.3
#: src/data/gaokao.js:79
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.4.C05.3.3"
msgid ""
"Bypass the corridor via the fourth lantern, treating night signals as "
"fresher than the map"
msgstr ""
"Bypass the corridor via the fourth lantern, treating night signals as "
"fresher than the map"

#. gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.4.C05.5
#: src/data/gaokao.js:79
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.4.C05.5"
msgid "Full-moon flow diverts through Pharmacy; a fourth lantern is not reliable guidance."
msgstr "Full-moon flow diverts through Pharmacy; a fourth lantern is not reliable guidance."

#. gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.5.C06.2
#: src/data/gaokao.js:80
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.5.C06.2"
msgid ""
"Yukari moves a classroom “between presence and absence.” What should a "
"student verify first?"
msgstr ""
"Yukari moves a classroom “between presence and absence.” What should a "
"student verify first?"

#. gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.5.C06.3.0
#: src/data/gaokao.js:80
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.5.C06.3.0"
msgid "Whether policy definitions of class location and attendance cover such an address"
msgstr "Whether policy definitions of class location and attendance cover such an address"

#. gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.5.C06.3.1
#: src/data/gaokao.js:80
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.5.C06.3.1"
msgid "Which side the teacher names as the room, using that declaration in place of policy"
msgstr "Which side the teacher names as the room, using that declaration in place of policy"

#. gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.5.C06.3.2
#: src/data/gaokao.js:80
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.5.C06.3.2"
msgid "Whether the campus router currently classifies the signal as on or off campus"
msgstr "Whether the campus router currently classifies the signal as on or off campus"

#. gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.5.C06.3.3
#: src/data/gaokao.js:80
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.5.C06.3.3"
msgid "Whether the roll marks the student absent, then use that result to define the location"
msgstr "Whether the roll marks the student absent, then use that result to define the location"

#. gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.5.C06.5
#: src/data/gaokao.js:80
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.common.questions.5.C06.5"
msgid ""
"The issue turns on institutional definitions of location and attendance; "
"inspect those boundaries first."
msgstr ""
"The issue turns on institutional definitions of location and attendance; "
"inspect those boundaries first."

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.name
#: src/data/gaokao.js:85
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.name"
msgid "Humanities Comprehensive"
msgstr "Humanities Comprehensive"

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.note
#: src/data/gaokao.js:86
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.note"
msgid "History, geography, journalism, faith, and public life"
msgstr "History, geography, journalism, faith, and public life"

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.0.H01.2
#: src/data/gaokao.js:88
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.0.H01.2"
msgid "Three sources disagree on an incident date. What is the best historical method?"
msgstr "Three sources disagree on an incident date. What is the best historical method?"

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.0.H01.3.0
#: src/data/gaokao.js:88
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.0.H01.3.0"
msgid "Convert all dates to one calendar, then average them into an incident date"
msgstr "Convert all dates to one calendar, then average them into an incident date"

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.0.H01.3.1
#: src/data/gaokao.js:88
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.0.H01.3.1"
msgid "Compare composition date, author position, and the calendar each source used"
msgstr "Compare composition date, author position, and the calendar each source used"

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.0.H01.3.2
#: src/data/gaokao.js:88
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.0.H01.3.2"
msgid "Prefer the earliest composition because it is less exposed to later memory"
msgstr "Prefer the earliest composition because it is less exposed to later memory"

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.0.H01.3.3
#: src/data/gaokao.js:88
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.0.H01.3.3"
msgid "Exclude the latest source until its date can be made to agree with the other two"
msgstr "Exclude the latest source until its date can be made to agree with the other two"

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.0.H01.5
#: src/data/gaokao.js:88
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.0.H01.5"
msgid "The disagreement is evidence; source conditions and calendars can explain how it arose."
msgstr "The disagreement is evidence; source conditions and calendars can explain how it arose."

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.1.H02.2
#: src/data/gaokao.js:89
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.1.H02.2"
msgid ""
"Shrine, temple, and hermitage contest one public-event budget. Which plan "
"best demonstrates public negotiation?"
msgstr ""
"Shrine, temple, and hermitage contest one public-event budget. Which plan "
"best demonstrates public negotiation?"

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.1.H02.3.0
#: src/data/gaokao.js:89
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.1.H02.3.0"
msgid "Split the budget equally first and require each party to fit its aims to that share"
msgstr "Split the budget equally first and require each party to fit its aims to that share"

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.1.H02.3.1
#: src/data/gaokao.js:89
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.1.H02.3.1"
msgid "Publish each party's aims, non-negotiables, shared costs, and remaining dissent"
msgstr "Publish each party's aims, non-negotiables, shared costs, and remaining dissent"

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.1.H02.3.2
#: src/data/gaokao.js:89
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.1.H02.3.2"
msgid "Weight funding by forecast attendance and publish only the adopted plan"
msgstr "Weight funding by forecast attendance and publish only the adopted plan"

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.1.H02.3.3
#: src/data/gaokao.js:89
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.1.H02.3.3"
msgid "Draw lots among complete proposals and deny shared facilities to the losing parties"
msgstr "Draw lots among complete proposals and deny shared facilities to the losing parties"

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.1.H02.5
#: src/data/gaokao.js:89
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.1.H02.5"
msgid ""
"Negotiation makes resources, positions, and unresolved dissent visible "
"instead of pretending conflict vanished."
msgstr ""
"Negotiation makes resources, positions, and unresolved dissent visible "
"instead of pretending conflict vanished."

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.2.H03.2
#: src/data/gaokao.js:90
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.2.H03.2"
msgid ""
"The Bamboo Forest shifts daily while Eientei's gate is relatively stable. "
"How should a map represent this?"
msgstr ""
"The Bamboo Forest shifts daily while Eientei's gate is relatively stable. "
"How should a map represent this?"

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.2.H03.3.0
#: src/data/gaokao.js:90
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.2.H03.3.0"
msgid "Draw the latest surveyed paths as solid lines and use the gate only for orientation"
msgstr "Draw the latest surveyed paths as solid lines and use the gate only for orientation"

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.2.H03.3.1
#: src/data/gaokao.js:90
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.2.H03.3.1"
msgid "Distinguish fixed anchors from conditional routes and timestamp each layer"
msgstr "Distinguish fixed anchors from conditional routes and timestamp each layer"

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.2.H03.3.2
#: src/data/gaokao.js:90
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.2.H03.3.2"
msgid "Print only each day's routes so fixed anchors do not create false confidence"
msgstr "Print only each day's routes so fixed anchors do not create false confidence"

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.2.H03.3.3
#: src/data/gaokao.js:90
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.2.H03.3.3"
msgid "Keep scale and gate, placing all route uncertainty in a note below the map"
msgstr "Keep scale and gate, placing all route uncertainty in a note below the map"

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.2.H03.5
#: src/data/gaokao.js:90
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.2.H03.5"
msgid ""
"Conditional geography must communicate stability and freshness, not disguise "
"temporary routes as fixed."
msgstr ""
"Conditional geography must communicate stability and freshness, not disguise "
"temporary routes as fixed."

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.3.H04.2
#: src/data/gaokao.js:92
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.3.H04.2"
msgid ""
"Keine distinguishes what happened, what was recorded, and what was permitted "
"to remain remembered. Which relation is closest?"
msgstr ""
"Keine distinguishes what happened, what was recorded, and what was permitted "
"to remain remembered. Which relation is closest?"

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.3.H04.3.0
#: src/data/gaokao.js:92
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.3.H04.3.0"
msgid "If two agree, a majority can reconstruct the single event that occurred"
msgstr "If two agree, a majority can reconstruct the single event that occurred"

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.3.H04.3.1
#: src/data/gaokao.js:92
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.3.H04.3.1"
msgid "Records and memory can both be shaped by power, media selection, and loss"
msgstr "Records and memory can both be shaped by power, media selection, and loss"

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.3.H04.3.2
#: src/data/gaokao.js:92
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.3.H04.3.2"
msgid "The earliest surviving record is closest to the event, and silence indicates absence"
msgstr "The earliest surviving record is closest to the event, and silence indicates absence"

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.3.H04.3.3
#: src/data/gaokao.js:92
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.3.H04.3.3"
msgid ""
"Long-corrected public memory is more reliable than contemporary records and "
"can adjudicate the event"
msgstr ""
"Long-corrected public memory is more reliable than contemporary records and "
"can adjudicate the event"

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.3.H04.5
#: src/data/gaokao.js:92
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.3.H04.5"
msgid ""
"Historical method studies selections and losses between event, record, and "
"public memory."
msgstr ""
"Historical method studies selections and losses between event, record, and "
"public memory."

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.4.H05.2
#: src/data/gaokao.js:93
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.4.H05.2"
msgid ""
"Aya publishes the headline first and verifies later. What is the largest "
"institutional risk?"
msgstr ""
"Aya publishes the headline first and verifies later. What is the largest "
"institutional risk?"

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.4.H05.3.0
#: src/data/gaokao.js:93
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.4.H05.3.0"
msgid "Readers may mistake the revised headline for a separate new incident"
msgstr "Readers may mistake the revised headline for a separate new incident"

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.4.H05.3.1
#: src/data/gaokao.js:93
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.4.H05.3.1"
msgid "Campus units may act on the error before correction can reverse its effects"
msgstr "Campus units may act on the error before correction can reverse its effects"

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.4.H05.3.2
#: src/data/gaokao.js:93
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.4.H05.3.2"
msgid "Other papers may repeat the headline without preserving its original layout"
msgstr "Other papers may repeat the headline without preserving its original layout"

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.4.H05.3.3
#: src/data/gaokao.js:93
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.4.H05.3.3"
msgid "The author may spend class time explaining the correction, reducing regular instruction"
msgstr "The author may spend class time explaining the correction, reducing regular instruction"

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.4.H05.5
#: src/data/gaokao.js:93
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.4.H05.5"
msgid ""
"A later correction cannot automatically reverse evacuations, accusations, or "
"resource decisions already made."
msgstr ""
"A later correction cannot automatically reverse evacuations, accusations, or "
"resource decisions already made."

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.5.H06.2
#: src/data/gaokao.js:94
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.5.H06.2"
msgid ""
"The Hakurei donation box repeatedly leaves campus. Which research question "
"is most analytical?"
msgstr ""
"The Hakurei donation box repeatedly leaves campus. Which research question "
"is most analytical?"

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.5.H06.3.0
#: src/data/gaokao.js:94
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.5.H06.3.0"
msgid "Whether the box initiates movement or is carried by the last person touching it"
msgstr "Whether the box initiates movement or is carried by the last person touching it"

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.5.H06.3.1
#: src/data/gaokao.js:94
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.5.H06.3.1"
msgid "How shrine and university rules of ownership, purpose, and location conflict"
msgstr "How shrine and university rules of ownership, purpose, and location conflict"

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.5.H06.3.2
#: src/data/gaokao.js:94
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.5.H06.3.2"
msgid "Whether red containers leave their assigned locations more often than others"
msgstr "Whether red containers leave their assigned locations more often than others"

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.5.H06.3.3
#: src/data/gaokao.js:94
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.5.H06.3.3"
msgid "Whether the last person holding the box should count as its lawful owner"
msgstr "Whether the last person holding the box should count as its lawful owner"

#. gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.5.H06.5
#: src/data/gaokao.js:94
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.humanities.questions.5.H06.5"
msgid ""
"It locates the recurring event in competing institutional claims instead of "
"ending with personification."
msgstr ""
"It locates the recurring event in competing institutional claims instead of "
"ending with personification."

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.name
#: src/data/gaokao.js:99
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.name"
msgid "Sciences Comprehensive"
msgstr "Sciences Comprehensive"

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.note
#: src/data/gaokao.js:100
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.note"
msgid "Magic experiments, hydropower, optics, pharmacology, and measurement"
msgstr "Magic experiments, hydropower, optics, pharmacology, and measurement"

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.0.S01.2
#: src/data/gaokao.js:102
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.0.S01.2"
msgid "Which design best isolates the effect of two starlight-magic materials?"
msgstr "Which design best isolates the effect of two starlight-magic materials?"

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.0.S01.3.0
#: src/data/gaokao.js:102
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.0.S01.3.0"
msgid "Keep caster and site fixed, but use the spell best suited to each material"
msgstr "Keep caster and site fixed, but use the spell best suited to each material"

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.0.S01.3.1
#: src/data/gaokao.js:102
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.0.S01.3.1"
msgid "Keep caster, spell, distance, and instrument fixed; change only material"
msgstr "Keep caster, spell, distance, and instrument fixed; change only material"

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.0.S01.3.2
#: src/data/gaokao.js:102
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.0.S01.3.2"
msgid "Keep spell and instrument fixed, testing each material at its usual site"
msgstr "Keep spell and instrument fixed, testing each material at its usual site"

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.0.S01.3.3
#: src/data/gaokao.js:102
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.0.S01.3.3"
msgid "Alternate materials, but let the caster adjust distance and dose after seeing each one"
msgstr "Alternate materials, but let the caster adjust distance and dose after seeing each one"

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.0.S01.5
#: src/data/gaokao.js:102
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.0.S01.5"
msgid ""
"Controlling other variables lets the observed difference be attributed "
"chiefly to material."
msgstr ""
"Controlling other variables lets the observed difference be attributed "
"chiefly to material."

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.1.S02.2
#: src/data/gaokao.js:103
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.1.S02.2"
msgid ""
"If the shorter-wavelength guide signal scatters more strongly in mist, what "
"practical effect is likely?"
msgstr ""
"If the shorter-wavelength guide signal scatters more strongly in mist, what "
"practical effect is likely?"

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.1.S02.3.0
#: src/data/gaokao.js:103
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.1.S02.3.0"
msgid "Both near and far views brighten, so directional judgment improves throughout"
msgstr "Both near and far views brighten, so directional judgment improves throughout"

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.1.S02.3.1
#: src/data/gaokao.js:103
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.1.S02.3.1"
msgid ""
"The nearby glow brightens while distant direct signal and direction become "
"harder to resolve"
msgstr ""
"The nearby glow brightens while distant direct signal and direction become "
"harder to resolve"

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.1.S02.3.2
#: src/data/gaokao.js:103
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.1.S02.3.2"
msgid "Nearby brightness falls while scattering concentrates more signal into distant outlines"
msgstr "Nearby brightness falls while scattering concentrates more signal into distant outlines"

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.1.S02.3.3
#: src/data/gaokao.js:103
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.1.S02.3.3"
msgid "Mist changes only perceived colour and leaves arrival-direction information unchanged"
msgstr "Mist changes only perceived colour and leaves arrival-direction information unchanged"

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.1.S02.5
#: src/data/gaokao.js:103
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.1.S02.5"
msgid ""
"Stronger scattering brightens the near haze while weakening directional "
"light from farther away."
msgstr ""
"Stronger scattering brightens the near haze while weakening directional "
"light from farther away."

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.2.S03.2
#: src/data/gaokao.js:104
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.2.S03.2"
msgid "A turbine loses output while head remains constant. What should be measured first?"
msgstr "A turbine loses output while head remains constant. What should be measured first?"

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.2.S03.3.0
#: src/data/gaokao.js:104
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.2.S03.3.0"
msgid "Remeasure head and, if unchanged, attribute the loss to measurement error"
msgstr "Remeasure head and, if unchanged, attribute the loss to measurement error"

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.2.S03.3.1
#: src/data/gaokao.js:104
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.2.S03.3.1"
msgid "Measure actual flow and inspect the runner for blockage"
msgstr "Measure actual flow and inspect the runner for blockage"

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.2.S03.3.2
#: src/data/gaokao.js:104
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.2.S03.3.2"
msgid "Compare output with lunar records to see whether both declined together"
msgstr "Compare output with lunar records to see whether both declined together"

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.2.S03.3.3
#: src/data/gaokao.js:104
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.2.S03.3.3"
msgid "Increase input flow until output recovers, then infer efficiency from the added flow"
msgstr "Increase input flow until output recovers, then infer efficiency from the added flow"

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.2.S03.5
#: src/data/gaokao.js:104
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.2.S03.5"
msgid ""
"Hydraulic power depends on flow; with head fixed, reduced flow or mechanical "
"blockage are direct candidates."
msgstr ""
"Hydraulic power depends on flow; with head fixed, reduced flow or mechanical "
"blockage are direct candidates."

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.3.S04.2
#: src/data/gaokao.js:105
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.3.S04.2"
msgid "When studying full-moon effects on spatial judgment, which comparison is most important?"
msgstr "When studying full-moon effects on spatial judgment, which comparison is most important?"

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.3.S04.3.0
#: src/data/gaokao.js:105
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.3.S04.3.0"
msgid "Use the same participants on an easier full-moon route to reduce navigation risk"
msgstr "Use the same participants on an easier full-moon route to reduce navigation risk"

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.3.S04.3.1
#: src/data/gaokao.js:105
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.3.S04.3.1"
msgid "Comparable participants on the same route at a similar time under a non-full moon"
msgstr "Comparable participants on the same route at a similar time under a non-full moon"

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.3.S04.3.2
#: src/data/gaokao.js:105
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.3.S04.3.2"
msgid ""
"Use different participants on another route in non-full-moon daylight for a "
"clear baseline"
msgstr ""
"Use different participants on another route in non-full-moon daylight for a "
"clear baseline"

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.3.S04.3.3
#: src/data/gaokao.js:105
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.3.S04.3.3"
msgid ""
"Repeat the full-moon route with the same participants to estimate average "
"practice effects"
msgstr ""
"Repeat the full-moon route with the same participants to estimate average "
"practice effects"

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.3.S04.5
#: src/data/gaokao.js:105
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.3.S04.5"
msgid ""
"The comparison should chiefly vary lunar phase while holding time, route, "
"and participant conditions similar."
msgstr ""
"The comparison should chiefly vary lunar phase while holding time, route, "
"and participant conditions similar."

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.4.S05.2
#: src/data/gaokao.js:106
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.4.S05.2"
msgid ""
"Marisa reproduces an explosion precisely, but records the material source "
"only as “found in the forest.” What is most impaired?"
msgstr ""
"Marisa reproduces an explosion precisely, but records the material source "
"only as “found in the forest.” What is most impaired?"

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.4.S05.3.0
#: src/data/gaokao.js:106
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.4.S05.3.0"
msgid "Determining whether exactly the same casting motions were used each time"
msgstr "Determining whether exactly the same casting motions were used each time"

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.4.S05.3.1
#: src/data/gaokao.js:106
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.4.S05.3.1"
msgid ""
"Enabling others to obtain equivalent material for an interpretable "
"independent replication"
msgstr ""
"Enabling others to obtain equivalent material for an interpretable "
"independent replication"

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.4.S05.3.2
#: src/data/gaokao.js:106
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.4.S05.3.2"
msgid "Comparing whether blast brightness correlates with flight speed"
msgstr "Comparing whether blast brightness correlates with flight speed"

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.4.S05.3.3
#: src/data/gaokao.js:106
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.4.S05.3.3"
msgid "Establishing whether forest material succeeds more often than library samples"
msgstr "Establishing whether forest material succeeds more often than library samples"

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.4.S05.5
#: src/data/gaokao.js:106
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.4.S05.5"
msgid ""
"Repeatable procedure is not traceable material; provenance is needed to "
"establish equivalence for independent replication."
msgstr ""
"Repeatable procedure is not traceable material; provenance is needed to "
"establish equivalence for independent replication."

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.5.S06.2
#: src/data/gaokao.js:107
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.5.S06.2"
msgid ""
"A bamboo navigator is accurate by day but drifts toward a fourth lantern at "
"night. What is the best next step?"
msgstr ""
"A bamboo navigator is accurate by day but drifts toward a fourth lantern at "
"night. What is the best next step?"

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.5.S06.3.0
#: src/data/gaokao.js:107
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.5.S06.3.0"
msgid "Retain the night data and designate the fourth lantern as the official night destination"
msgstr "Retain the night data and designate the fourth lantern as the official night destination"

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.5.S06.3.1
#: src/data/gaokao.js:107
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.5.S06.3.1"
msgid "Record sensor spectrum, lamp count, and time; run shielded and three-lamp controls"
msgstr "Record sensor spectrum, lamp count, and time; run shielded and three-lamp controls"

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.5.S06.3.2
#: src/data/gaokao.js:107
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.5.S06.3.2"
msgid "Compare mean day and night error and infer forest movement if night error is larger"
msgstr "Compare mean day and night error and infer forest movement if night error is larger"

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.5.S06.3.3
#: src/data/gaokao.js:107
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.5.S06.3.3"
msgid "Increase announcement volume and retest whether the navigator ignored instructions"
msgstr "Increase announcement volume and retest whether the navigator ignored instructions"

#. gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.5.S06.5
#: src/data/gaokao.js:107
msgctxt "text:gaokaoSubjects.science.questions.5.S06.5"
msgid ""
"The failure correlates with night lighting; measurements and controls can "
"separate sensor interference from route movement."
msgstr ""
"The failure correlates with night lighting; measurements and controls can "
"separate sensor interference from route movement."

